    <summary>Remove AI-generated watermarks from videos locally and offline using GPU-accelerated inference.</summary>
    <description>
## AI Watermark Remover

A high-performance Windows desktop application that integrates directly into the Windows File Explorer right-click context menu to detect and remove AI-generated watermarks from videos locally and offline.

### Features

- **GPU-Accelerated**: WebGPU compute shaders + ONNX Runtime with WASM SIMD fallback
- **Bundled AI Models**: AllenK FDnCNN models for different watermark sizes
- **Windows Shell Integration**: Right-click context menu for Windows 10 &amp; 11
- **Fully Offline**: No internet required after installation
- **Batch Processing**: Process multiple files at once

### Notes

- Windows only (x64)
- GPU with WebGPU support recommended for best performance
- Falls back to multi-threaded WASM SIMD on systems without WebGPU
    </description>
